The secondary programs are:


     uuclean   This program removes old files from the spool

               directory.


     uulog     This program reports on the  status  of  uucp

               requests.


     uusnap    This program prints a snapshot of the current

               uucp status.


     uustat    This  program  gathers  statistics  on   uucp

               requests.


     uuname    This program  lists  known  uucp  sites  with

               direct connections.


