The file


            C.res45n0031


would be a _w_o_r_k _f_i_l_e for a file transfer between  the  local

machine and the ``res45'' machine.


The scan for work is  done  by  looking  through  the  spool

directory  for  _w_o_r_k _f_i_l_e_s (files with prefix ``C.'').  When

you  have  sub-directories  all  subdirectories  whose  name

