It is assumed that the _l_o_g_i_n _n_a_m_e used by a remote  computer

to  call  into a local computer is not the same as the login

name of a normal  user  of  that  local  machine.   However,









                                                          37


several remote computers may employ the same login name.


Each computer  is  given  a  unique  _s_y_s_t_e_m  _n_a_m_e  which  is

transmitted at the start of each call.  This name identifies

